earwax headphone FIR (src/audio/earwax.ts)

src/audio/earwax.ts adapts FFmpeg libavfilter/af_earwax.c: the 64-entry int8
filt[] table split into the 30 and 330 degree 32-tap filters (config_input),
the 32-sample taps[2*NUMTAPS] history per input channel with its memcpy and
memmove paths (convolve), the int32 scalarproduct with >>7 and av_clip_int16,
the four convolutions and the clipped mix() into the two output channels
(filter_frame), and query_formats (s16p, stereo, 44100 Hz).

Fixed FFmpeg commit:946fcce07b6dcd0331c8cc609192aeff5e1924f8
